{
 "//": [
  "Does a themed colour resolve to the correct variant?",
  "",
  "Three columns. Under 'light' and 'dark' are two ordinary named colours, drawn as-is —",
  "they never change and are the reference. Under 'color theme' is a themed colour built",
  "from those same two named colours. Whatever the player does, the third swatch should be",
  "identical to the first in light mode and identical to the second in dark mode.",
  "",
  "Row 1 builds the themed colour from *references* to the named colours, which reaches",
  "RemoteComposeWriter.addThemedColor(lightId, darkId).",
  "Row 2 builds it from literals, which reaches addThemedColor(lightName, light, darkName,",
  "dark). The two take different paths through ResourceParser, so both are shown.",
  "",
  "The colours are far apart in every channel and sit on a mid-grey field belonging to",
  "neither, so a third outcome is distinguishable: a swatch matching NEITHER reference means",
  "the themed colour was never loaded at all, as opposed to being loaded with the wrong",
  "variant."
 ],
 "header": {
  "apiLevel": 7,
  "width": 480,
  "height": 300,
  "profiles": 513,
  "contentDescription": "themed colour vs named colour references",
  "orderedResources": true
 },
 "resources": {
  "colors": {
   "lightRef": "#FFFF00FF",
   "darkRef": "#FF00FFFF",
   "themedByRef": { "light": "$colors.lightRef", "dark": "$colors.darkRef" },
   "lightRef2": "#FFFF8000",
   "darkRef2": "#FF0080FF",
   "themedByValue": { "light": "#FFFF8000", "dark": "#FF0080FF" }
  }
 },
 "root": [
  {
   "global": [
    {
     "canvas": {
      "modifiers": ["fillMaxSize"],
      "commands": [
       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "#FF606060" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 0, "top": 0, "right": 480, "bottom": 300 } },

       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "#FF000000" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "textSize": 24 }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawTextAnchored": { "text": "light", "x": 90, "y": 34, "panX": 0, "panY": 0 } },
       { "drawTextAnchored": { "text": "dark", "x": 240, "y": 34, "panX": 0, "panY": 0 } },
       { "drawTextAnchored": { "text": "color theme", "x": 390, "y": 34, "panX": 0, "panY": 0 } },

       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.lightRef" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 20, "top": 50, "right": 160, "bottom": 160 } },
       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.darkRef" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 170, "top": 50, "right": 310, "bottom": 160 } },
       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.themedByRef" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 320, "top": 50, "right": 460, "bottom": 160 } },

       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.lightRef2" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 20, "top": 175, "right": 160, "bottom": 285 } },
       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.darkRef2" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 170, "top": 175, "right": 310, "bottom": 285 } },
       { "paint": { "ops": [{ "color": "@colors.themedByValue" }, { "style": "fill" }, { "alpha": 1.0 }] } },
       { "drawRect": { "left": 320, "top": 175, "right": 460, "bottom": 285 } }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
